  "description": "Ansible playbook runs from the rpi5 control node. Logs come from the systemd journal (tagged `ansible` by scripts/../run.sh) shipped to Loki by Alloy; the purple annotations are the community.grafana grafana_annotations callback (tag `ansible`).",
